<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="MarkViz — a browser-based student marks, analytics, ledger, and reporting workspace for teachers." />
  <title>MarkViz — Marks Visualization System</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/landing.css">
</head>

<body>

  <div class="nav-wrap">
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="#" class="brand"><span class="logo">M</span> MarkViz</a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#analytics">Analytics</a>
        <a href="#workflow">How It Works</a>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/login">Explore</a>
        <a class="btn primary" href="/login">Open Dashboard →</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <main>
    <section class="hero container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="reveal show">
          <span class="eyebrow">SMART STUDENT ANALYTICS</span>
          <h1>Turn marks into <span class="gradient">meaningful insights.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">
            MarkViz helps teachers manage students, enter marks, calculate results, compare exam performance, and
            create clear academic reports from one focused dashboard.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary large" href="/login">Open Dashboard <span>→</span></a>
            <a class="btn light large" href="#features">See how it works <span>↘</span></a>
          </div>
          <div class="proof">
            <div class="avatars"><span class="avatar a1">A</span><span class="avatar a2">R</span><span
                class="avatar a3">S</span><span class="avatar a4">+</span></div>
            <span>Built for everyday classroom record keeping</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="preview-wrap reveal show">
          <div class="glow"></div>
          <div class="float-card f1"><strong><span class="badge-dot"></span>92% Average</strong><small>Class performance
              improved</small></div>
          <div class="dashboard">
            <div class="dash-top">
              <div class="dash-brand">M MarkViz <span style="color:#a0a6b7;font-weight:500">/ Dashboard</span></div>
              <div class="dash-user"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="dash-content">
              <div class="dash-side">
                <div class="side-pill active"></div>
                <div class="side-pill"></div>
                <div class="side-pill"></div>
                <div class="side-pill"></div>
                <div class="side-pill"></div>
                <div class="side-pill"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="dash-main">
                <div class="dash-title"><b>Performance Overview</b><span class="tiny-select">First Term ▾</span></div>
                <div class="stats">
                  <div class="stat"><small>Registered Students</small><strong>12 / 55</strong><span class="up">Workspace</span></div>
                  <div class="stat"><small>Class Average</small><strong>78.4%</strong><span class="up">First Term</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="stat"><small>Exams Completed</small><strong>1 / 4</strong><span class="up">Progress</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="chart-card">
                  <div class="chart-head"><span>Subject Performance</span><span style="color:#8b91a4">This term</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="bars">
                    <div class="bar" style="height:54%"></div>
                    <div class="bar" style="height:76%"></div>
                    <div class="bar" style="height:67%"></div>
                    <div class="bar" style="height:91%"></div>
                    <div class="bar" style="height:73%"></div>
                    <div class="bar" style="height:84%"></div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="labels">
                    <span>Math</span><span>Eng</span><span>Sci</span><span>CS</span><span>Soc</span><span>Opt</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mini-row">
                  <div class="mini-card">
                    <div class="mini-flex">
                      <div><small style="color:#8b91a4;font-size:8px">Pass Rate</small><strong
                          style="font-size:16px">78%</strong></div>
                      <div class="ring"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mini-card"><small style="color:#8b91a4;font-size:8px">Quick insight</small>
                    <div class="lines"><span></span><span></span></div><strong style="font-size:10px">Results trending
                      up ↗</strong>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="float-card f2"><strong>CSV · XLSX</strong><small>Export academic records</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="trusted container">
      <p>DESIGNED FOR A CLEARER ACADEMIC WORKFLOW</p>
      <div class="logo-row"><span>MARKS
          ENTRY</span><span>ANALYTICS</span><span>COMPARISON</span><span>LEDGER</span><span>REPORTS</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="block" id="features">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <span>BUILT FOR MARKS MANAGEMENT</span>
          <h2>Everything you need to manage and understand results.</h2>
          <p>A focused workspace that transforms classroom marks into clear calculations, charts, ledgers, and reports.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">✎</div>
            <h3>Marks Entry</h3>
            <p>Enter theory, practical, and Test Exam marks with level-specific limits and completion checks.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">◔</div>
            <h3>Performance Analytics</h3>
            <p>Review class averages, pass rates, subject performance, individual results, GPA, and divisions.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">▤</div>
            <h3>Ledgers & Reports</h3>
            <p>Create Marks Ledgers, Grade Ledgers, Test Exam Reports, text reports, and printable result records.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">⇄</div>
            <h3>Exam Comparison</h3>
            <p>Compare completed terms, track percentage changes, and download comparison graphs or CSV data.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">✓</div>
            <h3>Test Exam Workflow</h3>
            <p>Handle Test Exam entry, ranking, subject pass and NG summaries, and student report cards separately.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature reveal">
            <div class="icon">⚙</div>
            <h3>Flexible Settings</h3>
            <p>Switch between Primary and Secondary levels and add, rename, or remove subjects for each level.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block" id="workflow">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <span>HOW MARKVIZ WORKS</span>
          <h2>From classroom marks to finished records.</h2>
          <p>Move through a simple workflow without manually repeating calculations.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature reveal"><div class="icon">1</div><h3>Register students</h3><p>Add roll numbers and names to create your class list.</p></article>
          <article class="feature reveal"><div class="icon">2</div><h3>Enter marks</h3><p>Choose the level and exam, then enter the required subject marks.</p></article>
          <article class="feature reveal"><div class="icon">3</div><h3>Review and export</h3><p>Inspect results, charts, rankings, ledgers, and downloadable reports.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block" id="analytics">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <span>READY-TO-USE OUTPUTS</span>
          <h2>See the result clearly, then take it with you.</h2>
          <p>MarkViz keeps the important academic views together: dashboards, student analysis, comparison charts, CSV files, Excel ledgers, and print-ready pages.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature reveal"><div class="icon">↗</div><h3>Charts that explain</h3><p>Use class, subject, individual, and Test Exam charts to spot performance patterns quickly.</p></article>
          <article class="feature reveal"><div class="icon">▥</div><h3>Accurate grading</h3><p>Automatic totals, percentages, GPA, divisions, grades, and PASS or NG results follow the selected level.</p></article>
          <article class="feature reveal"><div class="icon">⇩</div><h3>Useful exports</h3><p>Download CSV and Excel records or print ledgers and report cards through the browser.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta container" id="about">
      <div class="cta-box reveal">
        <h2>See the bigger picture behind every mark.</h2>
        <p>Start managing student marks with a clear, browser-based academic workspace. Your workspace data is saved in this browser on this device.</p>
        <a class="btn light large" href="/login">Launch MarkViz Dashboard →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

